WEBVTT

00:08.750 --> 00:10.980
This is proof of love.

00:10.980 --> 00:13.280
As long as this sword keeps shining,

00:13.610 --> 00:17.970
your father will be thinking 
of us forever and ever.

00:18.780 --> 00:20.250
Come on, Pram.

00:20.550 --> 00:21.350
Okay!

00:27.250 --> 00:28.050
Huh?

00:33.690 --> 00:36.660
Your father loves us...

00:37.550 --> 00:39.040
Loves us...

00:39.460 --> 00:40.810
Loves us...

01:13.890 --> 01:21.060
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:23.430 --> 01:30.210
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

01:30.210 --> 01:32.780
<i>A stolen smile</i>

01:32.780 --> 01:42.160
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

01:42.160 --> 01:46.790
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

01:46.790 --> 01:51.210
<i>For the final challenge</i>

01:51.210 --> 01:54.640
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

01:54.640 --> 02:00.840
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:00.840 --> 02:04.180
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:04.180 --> 02:11.230
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:11.230 --> 02:13.560
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:13.560 --> 02:16.200
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:16.200 --> 02:21.040
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:21.040 --> 02:23.370
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:23.370 --> 02:26.000
<i>To my own story</i>

02:29.500 --> 02:34.010
<b></b>Episode 4

02:29.500 --> 02:34.010
<b>  Forming
 a Party</b>

02:35.860 --> 02:38.480
Are you really sure this is okay?

02:40.760 --> 02:42.820
I spoke to them in advance to confirm.

02:46.270 --> 02:47.720
This is Desir Herrman.

02:48.300 --> 02:49.520
Come in.

02:51.030 --> 02:52.160
Excuse me.

02:53.120 --> 02:55.530
It seems you have enough party members.

02:55.840 --> 02:59.290
Yes. I've come to apply to form a party.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.290
Professor Brigitte.

03:06.540 --> 03:07.570
Enjoy.

03:13.190 --> 03:14.090
This is tasty!

03:14.540 --> 03:16.840
I'm glad you like it.

03:20.130 --> 03:21.650
Help yourselves to the sweets.

03:35.730 --> 03:38.400
So adorable!

03:38.830 --> 03:41.740
Well, why don't we get down to business?

03:42.350 --> 03:47.710
Desir Herrman, can you tell me 
why you want to form a party?

03:48.200 --> 03:52.170
I'm planning to get promoted to the alpha 
class by winning the ranking tournament.

03:57.050 --> 04:01.140
Do you have any idea how difficult that is?

04:02.330 --> 04:03.680
Of course I do.

04:04.100 --> 04:09.190
Um... Is getting promoted that hard to do?

04:09.190 --> 04:10.360
Yes.

04:11.270 --> 04:14.440
First, I'll explain how 
the ranking tournament works.

04:14.980 --> 04:21.730
The ranking tournament is an exam to 
determine the ranks of students in each grade.

04:24.800 --> 04:27.880
It's conducted with the alpha 
and beta classes together,

04:27.880 --> 04:32.920
and eligibility to participate requires
a party of three to six members.

04:34.230 --> 04:38.020
The exam takes the form of a 
battle between two parties.

04:38.020 --> 04:41.390
Basically, the winning party's rank goes up.

04:42.130 --> 04:46.770
That means parties with more 
members are at advantage.

04:47.200 --> 04:50.900
Not necessarily, since individual 
achievements are assessed.

04:51.870 --> 04:53.840
Besides beating the opponents,

04:53.840 --> 04:56.980
supporting your party members, 
intercepting the opponents...

04:56.980 --> 05:01.260
The key is how much you have contributed 
to the victory of your party.

05:01.260 --> 05:02.780
I see.

05:03.140 --> 05:08.870
The objective of the ranking tournament is 
to assess the various skills of the students.

05:11.470 --> 05:14.000
All of that is for qualifying rounds.

05:14.830 --> 05:18.380
The winning parties will 
participate in the final rounds.

05:19.080 --> 05:21.760
They take place in a Shadow World.

05:26.710 --> 05:33.230
Those who place within the top nine 
are given the title of single rankers.

05:33.670 --> 05:35.310
If you become a single ranker,

05:35.310 --> 05:38.480
you can advance from 
the beta class to the alpha class.

05:39.120 --> 05:43.190
That's why the ranking tournament 
is also called a promotional tournament.

05:43.820 --> 05:47.910
But no one has ever been promoted before.

05:48.470 --> 05:49.790
That's no surprise!

05:49.790 --> 05:53.870
Just think about the advantage 
alpha has over beta...

05:56.000 --> 05:58.160
It'll be completely one-sided.

05:58.160 --> 05:58.990
Right.

05:59.550 --> 06:04.500
In the past exams, the top students 
were all from the alpha class.

06:05.030 --> 06:06.400
I'll be honest with you.

06:06.400 --> 06:08.470
It's impossible to get promoted.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.930
That's why it's worth doing.

06:10.930 --> 06:12.510
Excuse me?!

06:12.940 --> 06:14.310
Think about it.

06:15.640 --> 06:21.460
What if a party of three, all of them in beta,
 became single rankers?

06:22.900 --> 06:29.090
It would prove the professors here, who 
claim the beta class isn't worth teaching

06:29.090 --> 06:31.200
because we're untalented, are all wrong.

06:33.100 --> 06:35.940
I'm a professor here, too, you know?

06:37.140 --> 06:38.460
Oh, I'm sorry.

06:38.460 --> 06:39.750
I'm kidding.

06:40.390 --> 06:44.530
If you can become single rankers...

06:45.170 --> 06:51.970
You might become the trigger to overhaul 
the rotten system at this academy.

06:51.970 --> 06:53.100
Yes, ma'am!

06:53.470 --> 06:54.840
I like your spirit.

06:55.750 --> 06:56.600
Lastly...

06:57.190 --> 06:58.570
Romantica Eru.

06:58.880 --> 07:00.110
Y-Yes.

07:00.640 --> 07:02.170
Pram Schnaizer.

07:02.170 --> 07:03.130
Yes?

07:03.550 --> 07:07.260
All party members' agreement 
is necessary to form a party.

07:07.580 --> 07:12.330
Do you still want to join his party 
after hearing all of this?

07:26.380 --> 07:30.090
Wow. I didn't know we had 
a place like this here.

07:33.240 --> 07:36.630
They practice all they want 
in a good environment.

07:36.630 --> 07:38.000
Must be nice.

07:38.600 --> 07:40.730
Only alpha class is allowed to use it.

07:43.070 --> 07:45.240
This is what we're allowed to use.

07:50.720 --> 07:53.200
Huh?! What the heck?!

07:53.200 --> 07:54.710
Y-You can't be serious!

07:55.280 --> 07:56.810
Are you really sure it's here?!

07:59.920 --> 08:02.540
The floor's creaking!

08:02.540 --> 08:05.110
Such a difference from the place we just saw.

08:05.760 --> 08:08.550
Agh, and so much dust...

08:08.550 --> 08:11.460
I'm sure it'll grow on us.

08:11.910 --> 08:12.430
Hmm?

08:18.350 --> 08:21.310
Wow... that's a big family.

08:34.500 --> 08:37.030
Holy moly...

08:37.680 --> 08:39.910
Well, then, let's clean up the room.

08:39.910 --> 08:40.830
No way!

08:41.210 --> 08:44.400
I can put up with dust and cobwebs 
and a worn-out room,

08:44.400 --> 08:46.340
but I can't take the rats!

08:46.650 --> 08:48.300
But you know...

08:48.300 --> 08:49.420
No!

08:49.980 --> 08:51.510
There's no other room.

08:51.510 --> 08:53.190
No! Way!

08:53.680 --> 08:56.250
Professor Brigitte found this room for us.

08:56.250 --> 09:00.200
No, no, no, no, no, no, no fricking way!

09:00.200 --> 09:01.500
Okay, fine.

09:01.500 --> 09:03.750
So you'll find us another room?!

09:04.410 --> 09:06.570
I'll plug the rat holes.

09:06.570 --> 09:08.440
Romantica, you clean up the room.

09:08.440 --> 09:10.050
Leave it to me!

09:10.050 --> 09:11.950
I'm good at cleaning!

09:12.390 --> 09:13.630
Oh, come on!

09:13.630 --> 09:15.300
Were you listening to me?!

09:15.300 --> 09:16.060
Were you?!

09:16.060 --> 09:18.120
Hey, were you?!

09:19.890 --> 09:20.960
Romantica.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.990
What?!

09:21.990 --> 09:24.380
I'm dead set on using this space.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.840
Where am I?

09:37.950 --> 09:39.330
Hello...?

09:45.870 --> 09:47.300
You woke up.

09:47.300 --> 09:48.290
That's good.

09:48.290 --> 09:50.490
I was just going to come wake you up.

09:51.900 --> 09:53.490
Oh, my gosh, I'm so sorry!

09:53.490 --> 09:55.730
You pushed through your injury?!

09:55.730 --> 09:57.460
Don't worry about it.

09:57.460 --> 09:59.580
How could I not?!

10:00.470 --> 10:02.670
You took care of everything...

10:02.670 --> 10:04.210
It's quite all right.

10:04.210 --> 10:08.300
Okay, now that you're awake, 
shall we get going?

10:09.700 --> 10:11.260
Yes...

10:12.360 --> 10:14.650
Let's go back and I'll take a shower—

10:14.650 --> 10:15.970
To start training.

10:15.970 --> 10:17.910
Excuse me?!

10:18.460 --> 10:20.890
So that we can become single rankers.

10:25.580 --> 10:27.690
Do you still want to join his party?

10:32.010 --> 10:36.800
<i>Everyone in the alpha class 
is obviously stronger than me.</i>

10:37.320 --> 10:41.150
<i>There's no way I can become 
a single ranker...</i>

10:45.480 --> 10:46.330
What?

10:46.890 --> 10:49.270
You're going to uncover my secret, right?

10:49.270 --> 10:51.050
What are you going to do, Romantica?

10:52.190 --> 10:54.790
You really piss me off...

10:55.930 --> 10:57.590
I will join him!

10:57.590 --> 10:58.840
Very well.

11:01.730 --> 11:04.600
I will join so that I can spend 
more time with Desir.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.830
I see... Ahem.

11:08.670 --> 11:11.250
I will approve your application 
to form a party.

11:13.050 --> 11:15.910
I knew I shouldn't have joined you.

11:19.430 --> 11:20.200
Fine!

11:20.200 --> 11:22.370
I'll do it, happy?!

11:23.010 --> 11:24.450
Come on, let's go!

11:27.090 --> 11:28.330
Romantica.

11:29.530 --> 11:30.790
What?

11:32.290 --> 11:33.960
The training room is this way.

11:41.120 --> 11:44.560
Romantica, I'm going to ask you 
to improve the accuracy of your magic.

11:44.560 --> 11:47.230
I'm actually pretty good at that.

11:54.220 --> 11:57.080
I can handle this many all at once, you see?

11:57.510 --> 11:58.700
Now fire them off.

11:58.700 --> 12:00.420
Just you watch.

12:02.660 --> 12:04.540
Wind Strike!

12:09.200 --> 12:10.290
So?

12:10.770 --> 12:11.480
Right.

12:12.190 --> 12:13.960
See if you can get them all to hit the center.

12:13.960 --> 12:14.710
What?!

12:15.170 --> 12:16.810
That's impossible—

12:16.810 --> 12:19.940
We've got no chance against 
alpha class unless you do.

12:22.260 --> 12:24.210
<i>I know you can do it.</i>

12:39.190 --> 12:42.350
<i>The you from my future proved that.</i>

12:44.530 --> 12:47.200
Well, if you aren't confident, 
then I guess that's that.

12:47.610 --> 12:50.430
You can be the cleaner of 
this room until you graduate.

12:54.050 --> 12:55.090
That smile of yours!

12:55.720 --> 12:57.760
Ugh, jeez!

12:57.760 --> 13:01.050
What do you want me to do?!

13:02.620 --> 13:03.700
What's this?

13:04.310 --> 13:08.350
Move the ball... to the circle over there.

13:11.300 --> 13:12.570
But no throwing it.

13:12.570 --> 13:13.300
Huh?

13:13.650 --> 13:15.820
Aren't you a mage?

13:16.450 --> 13:21.100
Manipulate the air current around 
the ball to move it to the circle.

13:29.220 --> 13:31.130
Wind magic is your forte, right?

13:31.960 --> 13:33.290
Of course it is!

13:33.630 --> 13:35.130
The basics are the same.

13:35.750 --> 13:38.010
Just do like you normally do it.

13:38.010 --> 13:40.220
Like I normally do...

13:40.220 --> 13:42.300
Visualize the wind.

13:44.610 --> 13:45.490
Okay!

13:53.500 --> 13:54.830
<i>Warm...</i>

13:55.790 --> 13:57.130
<i>Cold...</i>

13:57.980 --> 13:59.600
<i>Refreshing...</i>

14:02.210 --> 14:03.650
<i>Violent...</i>

14:05.570 --> 14:08.540
<i>But more importantly... Free!</i>

14:10.680 --> 14:11.450
<i>Now!</i>

14:23.350 --> 14:24.660
<i>Incredible.</i>

14:24.660 --> 14:26.580
<i>She got the hang of it in on the first try.</i>

14:27.960 --> 14:31.390
While that memory is fresh, 
please repeat the same exercise.

14:31.390 --> 14:32.390
Okay!

14:33.480 --> 14:34.850
<i>I got a compliment!</i>

14:36.960 --> 14:38.500
Your turn, Pram.

14:38.500 --> 14:39.320
Okay!

14:40.320 --> 14:42.110
What should I do?

14:42.110 --> 14:43.670
Swordsmanship?

14:43.670 --> 14:47.130
You'll teach me, right? Right?

14:47.130 --> 14:49.030
Well, um...

14:49.650 --> 14:52.870
There's nothing I can teach you.

14:53.210 --> 14:55.080
What?!

14:55.590 --> 14:58.190
But why not?!

14:58.190 --> 15:01.020
You perfected your craft as a sword master.

15:01.020 --> 15:04.670
You should be strong enough to win 
the ranking tournament as you are.

15:05.410 --> 15:08.570
That... can't be true.

15:13.730 --> 15:18.060
<i>If Pram demonstrates his 
full potential, that is.</i>

15:19.590 --> 15:23.820
<i>His swordsmanship, that tore through 
enemies with nothing but a rapier...</i>

15:24.420 --> 15:26.340
<i>It's not something I can forget.</i>

15:28.240 --> 15:30.660
Pram, can I ask you a question?

15:30.660 --> 15:31.830
Yes?

15:32.230 --> 15:34.250
Why did you choose the great sword?

15:36.410 --> 15:39.270
When you were fighting the swordsman 
from the alpha class the other day...

15:40.140 --> 15:43.250
I don't think that's how you usually fight.

15:45.160 --> 15:47.400
Your weapon should be something much lighter

15:47.730 --> 15:49.790
that allows you to take 
advantage of your agility...

15:50.370 --> 15:52.970
A rapier. Am I wrong?

15:54.430 --> 15:55.570
What do you say?

15:57.330 --> 16:01.360
Do I need to... tell you?

16:02.310 --> 16:04.810
It concerns the overall 
combat skills of the party.

16:05.180 --> 16:06.410
I'd like to know.

16:09.890 --> 16:14.740
In that case, would you come with me?

16:19.640 --> 16:23.230
Um, what about Romantica's training?

16:23.230 --> 16:24.250
Oh...

16:24.250 --> 16:27.840
Oh my gosh, check this out! So fun!!

16:27.840 --> 16:30.410
Aren't I amazing?!

16:32.740 --> 16:35.070
I'd rather not interrupt her.

16:35.640 --> 16:37.730
I'm sure she'll be all right.

16:41.860 --> 16:43.900
You trust her.

16:44.290 --> 16:47.650
Yes, as much as I trust you.

17:01.420 --> 17:02.520
This is it.

17:10.200 --> 17:12.510
I don't know what my father looks like.

17:13.770 --> 17:18.020
My mother was a commoner, 
and my father was a noble.

17:18.450 --> 17:20.540
I was born out of wedlock,

17:21.940 --> 17:26.170
and the only thing my father 
left behind is this.

17:27.360 --> 17:28.690
<i>There's no doubt about it.</i>

17:30.300 --> 17:32.560
<i>That's the weapon Pram used back then.</i>

17:34.210 --> 17:35.510
May I take a look?

17:37.550 --> 17:38.580
Please.

17:40.460 --> 17:41.960
So light.

17:42.540 --> 17:46.610
I learned about that sword when I was six.

17:48.050 --> 17:54.140
Hearing that my father left it to me,
 I started on the path of the sword.

17:58.900 --> 18:00.560
So that one day, when I got to see my father,

18:01.970 --> 18:05.730
I'd be a respectable son, 
fit to wield this sword.

18:06.900 --> 18:07.860
But...

18:09.250 --> 18:10.320
Pram.

18:11.330 --> 18:14.750
Do not ever try to visit your father.

18:15.280 --> 18:20.200
He lives in a different world than us.

18:21.910 --> 18:24.760
Yes, Mother.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.810
Please don't look like that.

18:29.620 --> 18:32.010
I love you, Pram.

18:36.760 --> 18:40.300
I love you, too, Mother...

18:43.750 --> 18:47.510
My mother never told me the name 
of my father until the end.

18:49.260 --> 18:54.150
<i>For nobility, a child with a commoner
 is nothing but a disgrace.</i>

18:55.200 --> 19:00.870
<i>If Pram had visited his father, 
he wouldn't have lived to be here.</i>

19:01.840 --> 19:04.650
<i>That's why she didn't tell him.</i>

19:06.390 --> 19:10.080
I wanted to know who my father is.

19:10.730 --> 19:15.550
I enrolled in Hebrion Academy 
to find my father.

19:16.000 --> 19:19.790
Nobles from many different 
countries come here,

19:19.790 --> 19:22.460
so I thought maybe I could 
get information about him.

19:22.910 --> 19:23.890
But...

19:24.700 --> 19:27.160
I got this appraised in town.

19:27.880 --> 19:30.700
I thought it might give me some clue.

19:31.820 --> 19:33.030
And...

19:34.890 --> 19:38.470
I was told it had no value as a sword!

19:40.200 --> 19:43.510
And it was not something 
worthy of a noble man!

19:44.000 --> 19:45.680
Isn't it awful?!

19:46.460 --> 19:48.710
I thought he loved my mother!

19:49.370 --> 19:52.240
I thought that's why he left this sword to me!

19:53.840 --> 19:54.670
But...!

19:56.860 --> 19:57.970
This piece of trash!

20:03.090 --> 20:04.250
Pram...

20:07.060 --> 20:09.050
I will never use that sword again.

20:10.260 --> 20:13.150
I don't want to.

20:27.240 --> 20:28.490
A sword, huh?

20:36.650 --> 20:37.700
How do you like that?!

20:37.700 --> 20:41.220
I completely mastered it in just three days!

20:41.220 --> 20:42.430
Good job!

20:43.110 --> 20:45.930
But it's out of the circle, so it doesn't count.

20:45.930 --> 20:47.000
Huh?

20:53.590 --> 20:54.670
What?

20:59.280 --> 21:01.610
Wh-Wh-Wh-What do you want?!

21:08.840 --> 21:11.330
Wh-Wh-What the heck is it?!

21:12.880 --> 21:16.310
Pram, could I take a look 
at your sword again?

21:17.890 --> 21:20.760
I don't care about that sword anymore.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.120
Sorry,

21:22.120 --> 21:24.640
but there's something I'd like to confirm.

21:25.490 --> 21:28.270
I'm sorry, but I can't show it to you.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.870
Just for a little bit. Please.

21:32.190 --> 21:33.420
I can't.

21:33.420 --> 21:34.270
What?

21:35.700 --> 21:37.730
Because I already sold it.

21:42.740 --> 21:45.490
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:45.490 --> 21:48.200
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:48.200 --> 21:51.810
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:56.290 --> 22:01.700
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:01.700 --> 22:06.300
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairy tale</i>

22:07.050 --> 22:12.420
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:12.420 --> 22:16.850
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:17.200 --> 22:23.370
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:23.370 --> 22:28.630
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:28.630 --> 22:33.660
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:33.660 --> 22:37.870
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:39.380 --> 22:42.150
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:42.150 --> 22:44.840
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:44.840 --> 22:48.350
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:50.220 --> 22:53.060
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:53.060 --> 22:55.640
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:55.640 --> 22:58.350
<i>Because this time</i>

22:58.350 --> 23:02.480
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode 5

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b>  Rapier</b>

23:36.120 --> 23:38.730
Next episode, "Rapier."
